{
  "app": "Candidatures",
  "version": 1,
  "description": {
    "fr": "Chercher un stage, une alternance ou un emploi : les offres collectées chaque matin sur tes sites, appréciées par l’IA selon tes critères, les CV adaptés, tes candidatures et leurs relances.",
    "en": "Looking for an internship, a work-study place or a job: offers collected each morning from your sites, appraised by the AI against your criteria, tailored CVs, your applications and follow-ups."
  },
  "models": [
    {
      "title": "JobSearch",
      "data": {
        "label": {
          "fr": "Profil de recherche",
          "en": "Job search"
        },
        "fields": [
          {
            "name": "poste",
            "type": "text",
            "required": true,
            "label": {
              "fr": "Poste recherché",
              "en": "Role"
            },
            "help": "Les mots de l’offre : « stage intelligence artificielle »",
            "aliases": ["query", "role", "job"]
          },
          {
            "name": "mots",
            "type": "long_text",
            "label": {
              "fr": "Mes mots",
              "en": "My words"
            },
            "help": "Une idée par ligne, ses façons de la dire séparées par | : intelligence artificielle|IA|AI|machine learning",
            "aliases": ["words", "keywords", "mots_cles"]
          },
          {
            "name": "lieu",
            "type": "text",
            "label": {
              "fr": "Lieu",
              "en": "Place"
            },
            "default": "France",
            "aliases": ["location", "ville"]
          },
          {
            "name": "contrat",
            "type": "choice",
            "label": {
              "fr": "Contrat",
              "en": "Contract"
            },
            "options": ["stage", "alternance", "cdi", "cdd", "freelance"],
            "optionLabels": {
              "stage": {
                "fr": "Stage",
                "en": "Internship"
              },
              "alternance": {
                "fr": "Alternance",
                "en": "Work-study"
              },
              "cdi": {
                "fr": "CDI",
                "en": "Permanent"
              },
              "cdd": {
                "fr": "CDD",
                "en": "Fixed-term"
              },
              "freelance": {
                "fr": "Freelance",
                "en": "Freelance"
              }
            },
            "aliases": ["contract"]
          },
          {
            "name": "debut",
            "type": "date",
            "label": {
              "fr": "À partir du",
              "en": "From"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "types",
            "type": "long_text",
            "label": {
              "fr": "Types",
              "en": "Types"
            },
            "help": "Un type par ligne et ses mots : « stage: stage|stagiaire|intern ».",
            "default": "stage: stage|stagiaire|intern|internship\nalternance: alternance|alternant|apprentissage|apprenti\ncdi: cdi"
          }
        ],
        "columns": ["poste", "lieu", "contrat", "mots"]
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "Source",
      "data": {
        "label": {
          "fr": "Source",
          "en": "Source"
        },
        "fields": [
          {
            "name": "lien",
            "type": "url",
            "label": {
              "fr": "Lien",
              "en": "Link"
            },
            "help": "Le site, prêt à ouvrir (une recherche déjà remplie)."
          },
          {
            "name": "url",
            "type": "text",
            "label": {
              "fr": "Adresse de recherche",
              "en": "Search address"
            },
            "help": "Ses {champs} prennent la valeur de chaque recherche : https://site/recherche?q={poste}&l={lieu}"
          },
          {
            "name": "active",
            "type": "boolean",
            "default": true,
            "label": {
              "fr": "Parcourue chaque matin",
              "en": "Read every morning"
            },
            "help": "Non : un site à ouvrir soi-même (il bloque les robots ou demande un compte) — gardé ici avec son lien."
          },
          {
            "name": "js",
            "type": "boolean",
            "label": {
              "fr": "Construite par script",
              "en": "Built by script"
            },
            "default": false
          },
          {
            "name": "recipe",
            "type": "long_text",
            "label": {
              "fr": "Recette",
              "en": "Recipe"
            },
            "help": "Écrite par l’IA (JSON) : schema { base, fields }, treg { route, body }, rename",
            "aliases": ["recette"]
          },
          {
            "name": "notes",
            "type": "long_text",
            "label": {
              "fr": "Notes",
              "en": "Notes"
            }
          }
        ],
        "columns": ["lien", "active", "notes"]
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "Criterion",
      "data": {
        "label": {
          "fr": "Critère de CV",
          "en": "CV criterion"
        },
        "fields": [
          {
            "name": "pour",
            "type": "choice",
            "label": {
              "fr": "Pour",
              "en": "For"
            },
            "options": ["offre", "cv"],
            "optionLabels": {
              "offre": {
                "fr": "apprécier une offre",
                "en": "appraising an offer"
              },
              "cv": {
                "fr": "noter un CV",
                "en": "grading a CV"
              }
            },
            "default": "cv"
          },
          {
            "name": "poids",
            "type": "number",
            "min": 0,
            "max": 100,
            "label": {
              "fr": "Poids",
              "en": "Weight"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "instruction",
            "type": "long_text",
            "label": {
              "fr": "Ce que l’IA vérifie",
              "en": "What the AI checks"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "ordre",
            "type": "number",
            "label": {
              "fr": "Ordre",
              "en": "Order"
            }
          }
        ],
        "columns": ["pour", "poids", "instruction"]
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "JobOffer",
      "data": {
        "label": {
          "fr": "Offre",
          "en": "Job offer"
        },
        "fields": [
          {
            "name": "company",
            "type": "text",
            "label": {
              "fr": "Entreprise",
              "en": "Company"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "location",
            "type": "text",
            "label": {
              "fr": "Lieu",
              "en": "Place"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "url",
            "type": "url",
            "unique": true,
            "label": {
              "fr": "Voir l’offre",
              "en": "See the offer"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "published",
            "type": "date",
            "label": {
              "fr": "Publiée le",
              "en": "Published"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "contract",
            "type": "text",
            "label": {
              "fr": "Contrat",
              "en": "Contract"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "type",
            "type": "choice",
            "label": {
              "fr": "Type",
              "en": "Type"
            },
            "options": ["stage", "alternance", "cdi", "autre"],
            "optionLabels": {
              "stage": {
                "fr": "stage",
                "en": "internship"
              },
              "alternance": {
                "fr": "alternance",
                "en": "work-study"
              },
              "cdi": {
                "fr": "CDI",
                "en": "permanent"
              },
              "autre": {
                "fr": "autre",
                "en": "other"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "source",
            "type": "text",
            "label": {
              "fr": "Source",
              "en": "Source"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "status",
            "type": "choice",
            "label": {
              "fr": "Étape",
              "en": "Step"
            },
            "options": [
              "new",
              "rated",
              "to_apply",
              "cv_ready",
              "applied",
              "interview",
              "refused",
              "accepted",
              "dismissed"
            ],
            "optionLabels": {
              "new": {
                "fr": "nouvelle",
                "en": "new"
              },
              "rated": {
                "fr": "appréciée",
                "en": "appraised"
              },
              "to_apply": {
                "fr": "à postuler",
                "en": "to apply"
              },
              "cv_ready": {
                "fr": "CV prêt",
                "en": "CV ready"
              },
              "applied": {
                "fr": "postulée",
                "en": "applied"
              },
              "interview": {
                "fr": "entretien",
                "en": "interview"
              },
              "refused": {
                "fr": "refusée",
                "en": "refused"
              },
              "accepted": {
                "fr": "acceptée",
                "en": "accepted"
              },
              "dismissed": {
                "fr": "écartée",
                "en": "dismissed"
              }
            },
            "default": "new"
          },
          {
            "name": "adequation",
            "type": "number",
            "min": 0,
            "max": 100,
            "label": {
              "fr": "Note (IA)",
              "en": "Note (AI)"
            },
            "help": "L’IA lit le contenu, ton CV maître et tes critères d’offre : à quel point l’offre te correspond, sur 100."
          },
          {
            "name": "avis_ia",
            "type": "long_text",
            "label": {
              "fr": "Pourquoi (IA)",
              "en": "Why (AI)"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "score",
            "type": "number",
            "min": 0,
            "max": 100,
            "label": {
              "fr": "Pertinence (mots-clés)",
              "en": "Relevance (keywords)"
            },
            "help": "Filtre sans IA : 100 = parle de ton domaine et de ton contrat. Décide ce qui est lu et apprécié, ne classe pas."
          },
          {
            "name": "reasons",
            "type": "text",
            "label": {
              "fr": "Mots trouvés",
              "en": "Words found"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "contenu",
            "type": "long_text",
            "label": {
              "fr": "Contenu de l’offre",
              "en": "Offer’s content"
            },
            "help": "Le texte complet de la page de l’offre, lu sans IA chaque matin, pour que l’IA le lise."
          },
          {
            "name": "position",
            "type": "location",
            "label": {
              "fr": "Position",
              "en": "Position"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "empreinte",
            "type": "text",
            "label": {
              "fr": "Empreinte",
              "en": "Fingerprint"
            },
            "help": "Mots du titre + entreprise : la même offre vue sur plusieurs sites ou plusieurs jours."
          },
          {
            "name": "sent_on",
            "type": "date",
            "label": {
              "fr": "Envoyée le",
              "en": "Sent on"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "follow_up",
            "type": "date",
            "label": {
              "fr": "Relancer le",
              "en": "Follow up on"
            },
            "aliases": ["relance", "due"]
          },
          {
            "name": "answer",
            "type": "long_text",
            "label": {
              "fr": "Réponse, notes",
              "en": "Answer, notes"
            }
          }
        ],
        "columns": ["company", "location", "type", "adequation", "status", "url"]
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "CV",
      "data": {
        "label": {
          "fr": "CV",
          "en": "CV"
        },
        "fields": [
          {
            "name": "role",
            "type": "choice",
            "label": {
              "fr": "Rôle",
              "en": "Role"
            },
            "options": ["master", "tailored", "template"],
            "optionLabels": {
              "master": {
                "fr": "CV maître",
                "en": "master CV"
              },
              "tailored": {
                "fr": "adapté à une offre",
                "en": "tailored to an offer"
              },
              "template": {
                "fr": "modèle de mise en page",
                "en": "layout template"
              }
            },
            "default": "tailored"
          },
          {
            "name": "offer",
            "type": "link",
            "target": "JobOffer",
            "inverse": "cvs",
            "label": {
              "fr": "Offre",
              "en": "Offer"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "content",
            "type": "long_text",
            "label": {
              "fr": "Contenu",
              "en": "Content"
            },
            "help": "Maître et adapté : Markdown. Modèle : une page HTML avec {{contenu}}."
          },
          {
            "name": "appreciation",
            "type": "number",
            "min": 0,
            "max": 100,
            "label": {
              "fr": "Appréciation de l’IA",
              "en": "AI appraisal"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "avis",
            "type": "long_text",
            "label": {
              "fr": "Avis",
              "en": "Review"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "state",
            "type": "choice",
            "label": {
              "fr": "État",
              "en": "State"
            },
            "options": ["draft", "ready", "sent"],
            "optionLabels": {
              "draft": {
                "fr": "brouillon",
                "en": "draft"
              },
              "ready": {
                "fr": "prêt (PDF)",
                "en": "ready (PDF)"
              },
              "sent": {
                "fr": "envoyé",
                "en": "sent"
              }
            },
            "default": "draft"
          }
        ],
        "columns": ["role", "offer", "state", "appreciation"]
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "JobSettings",
      "data": {
        "label": {
          "fr": "Réglages",
          "en": "Settings"
        },
        "fields": [
          {
            "name": "seuil_postuler",
            "type": "number",
            "min": 0,
            "max": 100,
            "default": 75,
            "label": {
              "fr": "À postuler d’office à partir de (note IA)",
              "en": "To apply automatically from (AI note)"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "seuil_pdf",
            "type": "number",
            "min": 0,
            "max": 100,
            "default": 80,
            "label": {
              "fr": "PDF du CV à partir de (note du CV)",
              "en": "CV PDF from (CV grade)"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "notes_par_jour",
            "type": "number",
            "min": 0,
            "max": 200,
            "default": 30,
            "label": {
              "fr": "Offres appréciées par jour, au plus",
              "en": "Offers appraised per day, at most"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "cv_par_jour",
            "type": "number",
            "min": 0,
            "max": 20,
            "default": 3,
            "label": {
              "fr": "CV écrits par jour, au plus",
              "en": "CVs written per day, at most"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "villes",
            "type": "text",
            "default": "Rouen, Paris (Île-de-France)",
            "label": {
              "fr": "Villes visées",
              "en": "Target cities"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "pages": [
    {
      "title": "Decide",
      "data": {
        "label": {
          "fr": "À décider",
          "en": "To decide"
        },
        "order": 1,
        "filters": [
          {
            "name": "type",
            "type": "choice",
            "options": ["tous", "stage", "alternance", "cdi", "autre"],
            "default": "tous",
            "label": {
              "fr": "Type",
              "en": "Type"
            }
          }
        ],
        "blocks": [
          {
            "block": "stat",
            "title": {
              "fr": "À apprécier",
              "en": "To appraise"
            },
            "query": {
              "kind": "JobOffer",
              "where": "score >= 100 and status = 'new' and ({type} = 'tous' or type = {type})",
              "aggregate": {
                "n": "count()"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "block": "stat",
            "title": {
              "fr": "Appréciées",
              "en": "Appraised"
            },
            "query": {
              "kind": "JobOffer",
              "where": "status = 'rated' and ({type} = 'tous' or type = {type})",
              "aggregate": {
                "n": "count()"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "block": "stat",
            "title": {
              "fr": "À postuler",
              "en": "To apply"
            },
            "query": {
              "kind": "JobOffer",
              "where": "(status = 'to_apply' or status = 'cv_ready') and ({type} = 'tous' or type = {type})",
              "aggregate": {
                "n": "count()"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "block": "stat",
            "title": {
              "fr": "Postulées",
              "en": "Applied"
            },
            "query": {
              "kind": "JobOffer",
              "where": "(status = 'applied' or status = 'interview') and ({type} = 'tous' or type = {type})",
              "aggregate": {
                "n": "count()"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "block": "table",
            "title": {
              "fr": "Dernières collectes",
              "en": "Last collections"
            },
            "query": {
              "kind": "Execution",
              "where": "service = 'Atelier'",
              "fields": ["action", "status", "started", "error"],
              "sort": "-started",
              "limit": 2
            }
          },
          {
            "block": "review",
            "title": {
              "fr": "Offres à décider, les mieux notées d’abord",
              "en": "Offers to decide, best noted first"
            },
            "kind": "JobOffer",
            "where": "score >= 100 and (status = 'new' or status = 'rated') and ({type} = 'tous' or type = {type})",
            "subtitle": ["company", "location"],
            "badge": "adequation",
            "fields": [
              "adequation",
              "avis_ia",
              "company",
              "location",
              "type",
              "contract",
              "published",
              "source",
              "status"
            ],
            "facets": ["type", "status", "source"],
            "link": "url",
            "sort": "-adequation",
            "action": {
              "label": "À postuler",
              "set": {
                "status": "to_apply"
              }
            },
            "more": [
              {
                "label": "Écarter",
                "set": {
                  "status": "dismissed"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "ToApply",
      "data": {
        "label": {
          "fr": "À postuler",
          "en": "To apply"
        },
        "order": 2,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "block": "datatable",
            "title": {
              "fr": "Offres à postuler",
              "en": "Offers to apply to"
            },
            "kind": "JobOffer",
            "where": "status = 'to_apply' or status = 'cv_ready'",
            "columns": ["company", "location", "adequation", "status", "url"],
            "facets": ["status", "type"],
            "link": "url",
            "sort": "-adequation",
            "action": {
              "label": "Postulée",
              "set": {
                "status": "applied"
              }
            },
            "more": [
              {
                "label": "Écarter",
                "set": {
                  "status": "dismissed"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "block": "datatable",
            "title": {
              "fr": "Mes CV adaptés",
              "en": "My tailored CVs"
            },
            "kind": "CV",
            "where": "role = 'tailored'",
            "columns": ["offer", "appreciation", "state"],
            "facets": ["state"],
            "sort": "-appreciation"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "Applied",
      "data": {
        "label": {
          "fr": "Postulées",
          "en": "Applied"
        },
        "order": 3,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "block": "datatable",
            "title": {
              "fr": "Mes candidatures",
              "en": "My applications"
            },
            "kind": "JobOffer",
            "where": "status = 'applied' or status = 'interview' or status = 'refused' or status = 'accepted'",
            "columns": ["company", "sent_on", "follow_up", "status", "url"],
            "facets": ["status"],
            "link": "url",
            "sort": "-sent_on",
            "action": {
              "label": "Entretien",
              "set": {
                "status": "interview"
              }
            },
            "more": [
              {
                "label": "Refusée",
                "set": {
                  "status": "refused"
                }
              },
              {
                "label": "Acceptée",
                "set": {
                  "status": "accepted"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "block": "calendar",
            "title": {
              "fr": "Les jours qui viennent",
              "en": "Days ahead"
            },
            "days": 14
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "All",
      "data": {
        "label": {
          "fr": "Toutes les offres",
          "en": "All offers"
        },
        "order": 4,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "block": "datatable",
            "title": {
              "fr": "Toutes les offres de mon domaine",
              "en": "Every offer in my field"
            },
            "kind": "JobOffer",
            "where": "score >= 100",
            "columns": ["company", "location", "type", "adequation", "status", "published", "url"],
            "facets": ["status", "type", "source", "location"],
            "link": "url",
            "sort": "-adequation",
            "action": {
              "label": "À postuler",
              "set": {
                "status": "to_apply"
              }
            },
            "more": [
              {
                "label": "Écarter",
                "set": {
                  "status": "dismissed"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "Tracking",
      "data": {
        "label": {
          "fr": "Suivi",
          "en": "Tracking"
        },
        "order": 5,
        "filters": [
          {
            "name": "type",
            "type": "choice",
            "options": ["tous", "stage", "alternance", "cdi", "autre"],
            "default": "tous",
            "label": {
              "fr": "Type",
              "en": "Type"
            }
          }
        ],
        "blocks": [
          {
            "block": "funnel",
            "title": {
              "fr": "Où en sont mes offres",
              "en": "Where my offers stand"
            },
            "kind": "JobOffer",
            "where": "score >= 100 and ({type} = 'tous' or type = {type})",
            "by": "status",
            "steps": ["new", "rated", "to_apply", "cv_ready", "applied", "interview"]
          },
          {
            "block": "live",
            "title": {
              "fr": "Offres publiées par jour, par type",
              "en": "Offers published per day, by type"
            },
            "data": {
              "kind": "JobOffer",
              "where": "score >= 100 and ({type} = 'tous' or type = {type})",
              "fields": ["published", "type"]
            },
            "height": 320,
            "code": "<div id=\"c\" style=\"padding:8px 12px 0\"></div><div id=\"l\" style=\"display:flex;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:12px;padding:6px 12px\"></div><script>\nconst J = JARVIS, T = J.theme, rows = J.rows;\nconst days = []; const today = new Date();\nfor (let i = 20; i >= 0; i--) { const d = new Date(today); d.setDate(d.getDate() - i); days.push(d.toISOString().slice(0, 10)); }\nconst types = ['stage', 'alternance', 'cdi', 'autre', 'none'];\nconst col = { stage: T.primary, alternance: T.ochre, cdi: T.info, autre: T.bark, none: T['rule-strong'] };\nconst lab = (t) => { const o = J.labels.type && J.labels.type.options; const v = o && o[t]; return v ? (v[J.lang] || v.fr) : (t === 'none' ? (J.lang === 'en' ? 'not set' : 'non défini') : t); };\nconst count = {}; days.forEach((d) => { count[d] = {}; });\nrows.forEach((r) => { const d = String(r.values.published || '').slice(0, 10); if (!count[d]) return; const t = r.values.type || 'none'; count[d][t] = (count[d][t] || 0) + 1; });\nconst total = (d) => Object.values(count[d]).reduce((a, b) => a + b, 0);\nconst max = Math.max(1, ...days.map(total));\nconst W = 720, H = 250, L = 34, B = 26, bw = (W - L - 8) / days.length;\nlet s = '<svg viewBox=\"0 0 ' + W + ' ' + H + '\" width=\"100%\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"' + J.title + '\">';\nfor (let g = 0; g <= 4; g++) { const v = Math.round(max * g / 4), y = H - B - (H - B - 12) * g / 4; s += '<line x1=\"' + L + '\" x2=\"' + W + '\" y1=\"' + y + '\" y2=\"' + y + '\" stroke=\"' + T.rule + '\"/><text x=\"' + (L - 6) + '\" y=\"' + (y + 4) + '\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"' + T.bark + '\">' + v + '</text>'; }\ndays.forEach((d, i) => {\n  let y = H - B;\n  types.forEach((t) => { const n = count[d][t] || 0; if (!n) return; const h = (H - B - 12) * n / max; y -= h; s += '<rect x=\"' + (L + i * bw + 2) + '\" y=\"' + y + '\" width=\"' + (bw - 4) + '\" height=\"' + h + '\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"' + col[t] + '\"><title>' + d + ' · ' + lab(t) + ' : ' + n + '</title></rect>'; });\n  if (total(d)) s += '<text x=\"' + (L + i * bw + bw / 2) + '\" y=\"' + (y - 4) + '\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"' + T.ink + '\">' + total(d) + '</text>';\n  if (i % 3 === 0) s += '<text x=\"' + (L + i * bw + bw / 2) + '\" y=\"' + (H - 8) + '\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"' + T.bark + '\">' + d.slice(8, 10) + '/' + d.slice(5, 7) + '</text>';\n});\ns += '</svg>';\ndocument.getElementById('c').innerHTML = s;\ndocument.getElementById('l').innerHTML = types.filter((t) => days.some((d) => count[d][t])).map((t) => '<span><i style=\"display:inline-block;width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:2px;margin-right:5px;background:' + col[t] + '\"></i>' + lab(t) + '</span>').join('');\n</script>"
          },
          {
            "block": "breakdown",
            "title": {
              "fr": "Par type",
              "en": "By type"
            },
            "query": {
              "kind": "JobOffer",
              "where": "score >= 100 and status != 'dismissed'",
              "groupBy": "type",
              "aggregate": {
                "n": "count()"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "block": "bar",
            "title": {
              "fr": "Ce que chaque site m’apporte",
              "en": "What each site brings"
            },
            "query": {
              "kind": "JobOffer",
              "where": "score >= 100 and status != 'dismissed' and ({type} = 'tous' or type = {type})",
              "groupBy": "source",
              "aggregate": {
                "n": "count()"
              },
              "sort": "-n",
              "limit": 12
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "Settings",
      "data": {
        "label": {
          "fr": "Réglages",
          "en": "Settings"
        },
        "order": 6,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "block": "datatable",
            "title": {
              "fr": "Mes seuils",
              "en": "My thresholds"
            },
            "kind": "JobSettings",
            "columns": ["seuil_postuler", "seuil_pdf", "notes_par_jour", "cv_par_jour", "villes"]
          },
          {
            "block": "datatable",
            "title": {
              "fr": "Mes critères",
              "en": "My criteria"
            },
            "kind": "Criterion",
            "columns": ["pour", "poids", "instruction"],
            "facets": ["pour"],
            "sort": "ordre"
          },
          {
            "block": "datatable",
            "title": {
              "fr": "Ce que je cherche",
              "en": "What I am looking for"
            },
            "kind": "JobSearch",
            "columns": ["poste", "lieu", "contrat"]
          },
          {
            "block": "datatable",
            "title": {
              "fr": "Où je cherche",
              "en": "Where I search"
            },
            "kind": "Source",
            "where": "lien != null",
            "columns": ["lien", "active", "notes"],
            "facets": ["active"],
            "link": "lien"
          },
          {
            "block": "form",
            "title": {
              "fr": "Ajouter une recherche",
              "en": "Add a search"
            },
            "kind": "JobSearch"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "rules": [
    {
      "title": "Offres du matin",
      "data": {
        "when": {
          "schedule": "0 7 * * *"
        },
        "then": [
          {
            "call": {
              "connection": "Atelier",
              "path": "/jobs/parcourir",
              "include": {
                "searches": "JobSearch",
                "sources": "Source"
              },
              "save": {
                "kind": "JobOffer",
                "match": ["empreinte", "url"],
                "title": "{title}",
                "raw": "Capture"
              },
              "long": true,
              "minutes": 30,
              "body": {
                "situer": "location"
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "Lire les offres",
      "data": {
        "when": {
          "schedule": "30 7 * * *"
        },
        "then": [
          {
            "call": {
              "connection": "Atelier",
              "path": "/jobs/lire",
              "include": {
                "pages": {
                  "kind": "JobOffer",
                  "where": "score >= 100 and status != 'dismissed' and contenu = null",
                  "limit": 40
                }
              },
              "save": {
                "kind": "JobOffer",
                "match": "url"
              },
              "long": true,
              "minutes": 120
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "Relance d’une candidature",
      "data": {
        "when": {
          "before": {
            "kind": "JobOffer",
            "field": "follow_up",
            "days": 0
          }
        },
        "if": "status = 'applied'",
        "then": [
          {
            "remind": {
              "text": "Relancer : {title} ({company})"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "scripts": [],
  "role": {
    "covers": {
      "fr": "Chercher un stage, une alternance ou un emploi : les offres collectées chaque matin sur tes sites, appréciées par l’IA selon tes critères, les CV adaptés, tes candidatures et leurs relances.",
      "en": "Looking for an internship, a work-study place or a job: offers collected each morning from your sites, appraised by the AI against your criteria, tailored CVs, your applications and follow-ups."
    },
    "intents": [
      "stage",
      "alternance",
      "emploi",
      "job",
      "offre",
      "offres",
      "candidature",
      "candidater",
      "postuler",
      "postulé",
      "postule",
      "recrutement",
      "recruteur",
      "entretien",
      "cv",
      "lettre de motivation",
      "relance",
      "relancer",
      "cdi",
      "cdd",
      "site d’emploi",
      "sites d’offres"
    ],
    "watches": ["JobSearch", "Source", "JobOffer", "Fichier", "CV", "Criterion", "JobSettings"],
    "reads": ["JobSearch", "Source", "JobOffer", "CV", "Criterion", "JobSettings"],
    "writes": ["JobSearch", "Source", "JobOffer", "CV", "Criterion", "JobSettings"],
    "ask": [
      {
        "fr": "Quel poste, où, et quel contrat ?",
        "en": "Which role, where, and which contract?"
      },
      {
        "fr": "On fixe tes critères pour apprécier les offres ?",
        "en": "Shall we set your criteria for appraising offers?"
      },
      {
        "fr": "À partir de quelle note je prépare le CV ?",
        "en": "From which note do I prepare the CV?"
      }
    ],
    "instructions": {
      "fr": "Trois étapes. 1) Collecte sans IA : à 7 h les offres arrivent en « JobOffer » (étape new), à 7 h 30 leur texte complet dans « contenu ». 2) Appréciation : lis « contenu », son « CV » maître et ses « Criterion » pour offre ; écris « adequation » (0-100) et « avis_ia » ; étape rated, ou to_apply si la note atteint « seuil_postuler » (« JobSettings »). 3) Préparation, pour chaque offre to_apply : un « CV » adapté relié à l’offre, sans rien inventer, noté avec ses « Criterion » pour cv ; à « seuil_pdf » ou plus, pdf du modèle rempli, fichier relié, étape cv_ready. Elle postule : étape applied, « sent_on », « follow_up ». Rien n’est envoyé sans son oui.",
      "en": "Three steps. 1) Collect without AI: at 7 offers arrive as « JobOffer » (step new), at 7:30 their full text in « contenu ». 2) Appraise: read « contenu », her master « CV » and her offer « Criterion » entries; write « adequation » (0-100) and « avis_ia »; step rated, or to_apply when the note reaches « seuil_postuler » (« JobSettings »). 3) Prepare, for each to_apply offer: a tailored « CV » linked to the offer, inventing nothing, graded with her cv « Criterion » entries; at « seuil_pdf » or more, pdf of the filled template, file linked, step cv_ready. She applies: step applied, « sent_on », « follow_up ». Nothing is sent without her yes."
    },
    "capabilities": ["chercher", "lire", "parcourir", "pdf", "situer"],
    "bridges": []
  }
}
